  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch holds a second meeting after Wu Shuai urges remaining grotto-heaven forces to gather. Among human rank eight Gu Immortals, besides Night Heavenly Wolf Lord and Lady Cold Ash, the newcomers include light path cultivator Crossing Heaven Immortal Monarch, wood path cultivator Black Locust, and earth path female immortal Rainbow Rock Immortal Concubine. There are only five human rank eights against almost ten variant human rank eights.",
      "chapters": [
        1981
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ice_crystal_immortal_monarch",
        "char_wu_shuai",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_night_heavenly_wolf_lord",
        "char_lady_cold_ash",
        "char_crossing_heaven_immortal_monarch",
        "char_black_locust"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Xia clan headquarters, over ten variant human Gu Immortals stand in a standoff. A third group of human Gu Immortals holds Crossing Heaven Immortal Monarch, Black Locust, and Rainbow Rock Immortal Concubine. When variant human Gu Immortals argue that the two heavens alliance should be a pure variant human alliance and call the human Gu Immortals’ battle performance bad, those three stand pale and close together.",
      "chapters": [
        2068
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "xia-clan-standoff",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_xia_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan and Wu Shuai arrive and end the quarrel. Fang Yuan offers two choices about annexing grotto-heavens to resolve the qi harvest fruit disaster. Rainbow Rock Immortal Concubine breaks the silence and asks respectfully what the other choice is. Fang Yuan answers that the second choice is that he will kill them all and then annex their grotto-heavens.",
      "chapters": [
        2068
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "xia-clan-standoff",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During a later wave of immortal ascension inside the sovereign immortal aperture, narration names Rainbow Rock Immortal Concubine among Gu Masters who ascend, together with others revived after Crazed Demon Cave deaths. Fang Yuan had revived most of those Gu Immortals only at Gu Master level so they could ascend again under that trend.",
      "chapters": [
        2291
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immortal-ascension-wave",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "loc_crazed_demon_cave",
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    }
  ],
